    fix(tests): bound curl probes + orphan reaper test (DB-GAP-059)
    
    tests/helpers.ts curl() adds --max-time 10 so a stalled daemon fails the
    test instead of hanging the suite forever (mirror INT-CI-003 waitForUrl
    pattern). New test asserts no orphaned test-spawned daemons survive the
    suite (catches test-infra leaks the host reaper skips).
    
    Scratch daemons already use isolated DUCKBRAIN_NAMESPACES_PATH (helpers.ts
    lines 329-344 set it to a temp dir when not supplied), so no change needed
    there.
    
    Addresses DB-GAP-059.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
